  "title": "03/26/26 – Precision Optics Corporation, Inc. Announces Proposed Public Offering of Common Stock",
  "summary": "GARDNER, Mass., March 26, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Precision Optics Corporation, Inc. (NASDAQ: POCI), a leading designer and manufacturer of advanced optical instruments for the medical and defense/aerospace industries, today announced that it is commencing an underwritten public offering of shares of its common stock (or common stock equivalents). The offering is subject to market […]",
